      "original": {
        "heading": "A note on names",
        "kicker": "",
        "paragraphs": [
          "This is a parody. No real professors, officers or staff are named anywhere on this website; every name shown is the fictional pirate Gold D. Roger. For the institute’s real administration, use the official IIT (ISM) Dhanbad website."
        ],
        "aside": {
          "label": "",
          "text": ""
        }
      },
      "pirate": {
        "heading": "A note on the crew list",
        "kicker": "",
        "paragraphs": [
          "We could not decide who should run which part of the ship, so we gave every job to Gold D. Roger. The real people who run the real institute are listed on the official IIT (ISM) Dhanbad website."
        ],
        "aside": {
          "label": "Navigator’s note",
          "text": "If you email the Captain, the First Mate and the Quartermaster at once, you will get one reply."
        }
